# FinSecure AI – Real-Time Fraud Detection Platform

Dataset:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ealaxi/paysim1

## Overview

FinSecure AI is an end-to-end Machine Learning powered fraud detection platform that analyzes financial transactions in real time and predicts fraudulent activities using an XGBoost model.

The system provides instant fraud risk assessment, probability scores, and AI-generated explanations through a web-based interface and REST API.

---

## Live Demo

Frontend:
https://finsecure-ai-production.up.railway.app

API Documentation:
https://finsecure-ai-production.up.railway.app/docs

---

## Features

- Real-time fraud prediction
- Machine Learning powered risk scoring
- XGBoost classification model
- FastAPI backend
- AI-generated transaction analysis using Groq LLM
- Interactive web interface
- REST API for integration
- Cloud deployment using Railway

---

## Performance Metrics

| Metric | Value |
|----------|----------|
| AUC-ROC | 99.98% |
| Precision | 80.34% |
| Recall | 99.20% |
| Dataset Size | 6.3 Million Transactions |

