## Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/SiddharthaSangani18/FinSecure-AI.git

cd FinSecure-AI
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Configure Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file:

```env
GROQ_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
```

### Run Application

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

### Open Browser

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

API Docs:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```

---

## Dataset

PaySim Financial Transactions Dataset

- 6.3 Million Records
- Synthetic mobile money transactions
- Fraud and non-fraud transactions

Dataset Link:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ealaxi/paysim1

---

## Feature Engineering

Key features used by the model:

- Transaction Amount
- Hours Since Last Transaction
- Number of Transactions in 24 Hours
- Destination Account Status
- Origin Account Balance
- Destination Account Balance
- Transaction Type
- Balance Change Patterns

---

## API Endpoint

### Predict Fraud

```http
POST /predict
```

Example Response:

```json
{
  "prediction": "Legitimate",
  "fraud_probability": 0.46,
  "risk_level": "Low Risk"
}
```

